            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Writing Your Way to Healing",
            "content": "<p>Writing has long served as a clinical tool for emotional processing, reflection, and integration. In this guided workshop, Dr. Niki Serravalle leads participants through a structured series of writing experiences designed to support nervous system regulation, bring language to what is hard to name, and create space for personal insight.</p><p>Open to clinicians, helping professionals, and adults drawn to writing as a path to healing.</p>",
            "link_text": "Join The Waitlist",
            "link_url": "shopify://pages/newsletters",
            "background": "#1d486f",
